{
  "_note": "The gesture book (pepin.expression.book): the motion atoms, the compositions the brain names in its text ({laugh}) or through the gesture tool, the arm poses taught by hand, the idle layer and the robot's moments. An atom is ONE cycle of keys at shares (at 0..1) of its period_s; a value is a number, \"$param\" or \"-$param\" of its params (drawn uniformly from [lo, hi] at each performance); repeats and hold_s are reserved. Degrees: the head's pan_deg + left, tilt_deg + down (offsets on whatever holds the head); the arm's joints in config/arm.json's convention (additive: offsets on the pose under it; absolute: a pose, starting and ending on rest); the wheels' yaw_deg + left and x_m + forward (no wheel executor yet: those steps are left out). A step's at_s puts the atom's stroke (stroke x its first cycle) that far from the marker's word (negative: before it), p is the chance it plays, params narrow the atom's ranges, a string or a list of strings names a face (name) or a pose (pose). Timing and variety from .claude/research/brain/expression/expressive_motion.md (2026-10-11): strokes on the word or up to 0.2 s before it, amplitude ranges of about +-20 %, period ranges of about +-12 %, optional parts with their odds, mirror images, never the same variant twice running. Arm atoms are sized to keep config/arm.json's caps (90 deg/s, 360 deg/s^2) at speed 1: the arm's beats and clicks are slow, so emphasis and laughter ride the head and the face; raise the caps on the bench before raising these.",
  "poses": {
    "note": "Arm poses taught by hand (scripts/gesture.py teach NAME: torque off, the arm placed, its six angles written here), one angle per joint of config/arm.json. rest is not here: it is config/arm.json's motion.rest_deg. None is taught yet: a step naming a pose that is not here is left out (the rest of the gesture plays). The compositions name raised (the forearm up, ready to wave) and offer (the gripper forward, open hand)."
  },
  "atoms": {
    "head_nod": {
      "part": "head", "mode": "additive", "stroke": 0.5,
      "params": {"amp_deg": [3.0, 6.0], "lift_deg": [0.5, 1.5], "period_s": [0.35, 0.5], "repeats": 1},
      "keys": [{"at": 0.0, "tilt_deg": 0.0}, {"at": 0.15, "tilt_deg": "-$lift_deg"}, {"at": 0.5, "tilt_deg": "$amp_deg"}, {"at": 1.0, "tilt_deg": 0.0}],
      "note": "down first with a 1 deg lift before it; the mast rings at 5.3 Hz after sharp tilts: tilt cycles stay under 2.5 Hz (period over 0.4 s at 3-6 deg)"
    },
    "head_shake": {
      "part": "head", "mode": "additive", "stroke": 0.25,
      "params": {"amp_deg": [4.0, 9.0], "period_s": [0.35, 0.45], "repeats": [1, 2]},
      "keys": [{"at": 0.0, "pan_deg": 0.0}, {"at": 0.25, "pan_deg": "$amp_deg"}, {"at": 0.75, "pan_deg": "-$amp_deg"}, {"at": 1.0, "pan_deg": 0.0}],
      "mirror": ["pan_deg"],
      "note": "no: either side first"
    },
    "head_back": {
      "part": "head", "mode": "additive", "stroke": 0.3,
      "params": {"amp_deg": [3.0, 8.0], "period_s": [1.0, 1.6]},
      "keys": [{"at": 0.0, "tilt_deg": 0.0}, {"at": 0.3, "tilt_deg": "-$amp_deg"}, {"at": 0.7, "tilt_deg": "-$amp_deg"}, {"at": 1.0, "tilt_deg": 0.0}],
      "note": "the head up and held (energy, joy, a laugh's throw back)"
    },
    "head_drop": {
      "part": "head", "mode": "additive", "stroke": 0.3,
      "params": {"amp_deg": [2.0, 6.0], "period_s": [1.2, 2.0]},
      "keys": [{"at": 0.0, "tilt_deg": 0.0}, {"at": 0.3, "tilt_deg": "$amp_deg"}, {"at": 0.7, "tilt_deg": "$amp_deg"}, {"at": 1.0, "tilt_deg": 0.0}],
      "note": "the head down and held (sadness, doubt, sympathy)"
    },
    "head_glance": {
      "part": "head", "mode": "additive", "stroke": 0.2,
      "params": {"side_deg": [10.0, 20.0], "up_deg": [3.0, 8.0], "period_s": [1.6, 2.4]},
      "keys": [{"at": 0.0, "pan_deg": 0.0, "tilt_deg": 0.0}, {"at": 0.2, "pan_deg": "$side_deg", "tilt_deg": "-$up_deg"}, {"at": 0.8, "pan_deg": "$side_deg", "tilt_deg": "-$up_deg"}, {"at": 1.0, "pan_deg": 0.0, "tilt_deg": 0.0}],
      "mirror": ["pan_deg"],
      "note": "a look away, up and to a side, and back (thinking: seen as thoughtful and interrupted less)"
    },
    "head_cock": {
      "part": "head", "mode": "additive", "stroke": 0.3,
      "params": {"pan_deg": [6.0, 10.0], "tilt_deg": [2.0, 4.0], "period_s": [1.0, 1.6]},
      "keys": [{"at": 0.0, "pan_deg": 0.0, "tilt_deg": 0.0}, {"at": 0.3, "pan_deg": "$pan_deg", "tilt_deg": "$tilt_deg"}, {"at": 0.7, "pan_deg": "$pan_deg", "tilt_deg": "$tilt_deg"}, {"at": 1.0, "pan_deg": 0.0, "tilt_deg": 0.0}],
      "mirror": ["pan_deg"],
      "note": "the stand-in for a head tilt (the neck has no roll)"
    },
    "recoil": {
      "part": "head", "mode": "additive", "stroke": 0.15,
      "params": {"amp_deg": [6.0, 10.0], "period_s": [0.9, 1.2]},
      "keys": [{"at": 0.0, "tilt_deg": 0.0}, {"at": 0.15, "tilt_deg": "-$amp_deg"}, {"at": 0.6, "tilt_deg": "-$amp_deg"}, {"at": 1.0, "tilt_deg": 0.0}],
      "note": "a quick lift of the head (surprise), held, settled slowly"
    },
    "head_drift": {
      "part": "head", "mode": "additive", "stroke": 0.3, "callable": false,
      "params": {"side_deg": [2.0, 5.0], "up_deg": [0.0, 2.0], "period_s": [2.0, 3.0]},
      "keys": [{"at": 0.0, "pan_deg": 0.0, "tilt_deg": 0.0}, {"at": 0.3, "pan_deg": "$side_deg", "tilt_deg": "-$up_deg"}, {"at": 0.7, "pan_deg": "$side_deg", "tilt_deg": "-$up_deg"}, {"at": 1.0, "pan_deg": 0.0, "tilt_deg": 0.0}],
      "mirror": ["pan_deg"],
      "note": "the idle layer's fidget: a small slow look aside and back"
    },
    "breath": {
      "part": "head", "mode": "additive", "stroke": 0.25, "callable": false,
      "params": {"amp_deg": 0.6, "period_s": 4.0, "repeats": 3},
      "keys": [{"at": 0.0, "tilt_deg": 0.0}, {"at": 0.25, "tilt_deg": "-$amp_deg"}, {"at": 0.75, "tilt_deg": "$amp_deg"}, {"at": 1.0, "tilt_deg": 0.0}],
      "note": "+-0.6 deg at 0.25 Hz (config/face.json's breathe_hz); not in the idle layer while a head overlay blinds the speaker gaze's frames"
    },
    "body_turn": {
      "part": "body", "mode": "additive", "stroke": 0.6,
      "params": {"amp_deg": [10.0, 30.0], "period_s": [0.6, 1.0]},
      "keys": [{"at": 0.0, "yaw_deg": 0.0}, {"at": 1.0, "yaw_deg": "$amp_deg"}],
      "mirror": ["yaw_deg"],
      "note": "a turn in place (stays turned); no wheel executor yet"
    },
    "body_wiggle": {
      "part": "body", "mode": "additive", "stroke": 0.25,
      "params": {"amp_deg": [2.0, 5.0], "period_s": [0.7, 1.0], "repeats": [2, 4]},
      "keys": [{"at": 0.0, "yaw_deg": 0.0}, {"at": 0.25, "yaw_deg": "$amp_deg"}, {"at": 0.75, "yaw_deg": "-$amp_deg"}, {"at": 1.0, "yaw_deg": 0.0}],
      "mirror": ["yaw_deg"],
      "note": "yaw +-3 deg, back to the start pose; no wheel executor yet"
    },
    "body_rock": {
      "part": "body", "mode": "additive", "stroke": 0.5,
      "params": {"amp_m": [0.01, 0.02], "period_s": [0.5, 0.7]},
      "keys": [{"at": 0.0, "x_m": 0.0}, {"at": 0.5, "x_m": "$amp_m"}, {"at": 1.0, "x_m": 0.0}],
      "note": "forward 1-2 cm and back; no wheel executor yet"
    },
    "arm_pose": {
      "part": "arm", "mode": "absolute", "stroke": 1.0,
      "params": {"period_s": [1.3, 1.5], "hold_s": [1.5, 2.0]},
      "keys": [{"at": 0.0, "pose": "rest"}, {"at": 1.0, "pose": "$pose"}],
      "note": "rest -> a taught pose in period_s (the stroke: arriving; 1.3 s keeps a 60 deg move within 90 deg/s and 360 deg/s^2), held hold_s; then the board takes the arm back to rest by itself at its caps and lets go"
    },
    "arm_wave": {
      "part": "arm", "mode": "additive", "stroke": 0.25,
      "params": {"amp_deg": [8.0, 10.0], "period_s": [1.5, 1.7], "repeats": [2, 3]},
      "keys": [{"at": 0.0, "wrist_flex": 0.0}, {"at": 0.3, "wrist_flex": "$amp_deg"}, {"at": 0.7, "wrist_flex": "-$amp_deg"}, {"at": 1.0, "wrist_flex": 0.0}],
      "mirror": ["wrist_flex"],
      "note": "the hand waved by the wrist on the pose under it (raised when taught, else rest); +-10 deg at 0.65 Hz is about the most 360 deg/s^2 allows (the swing's peak acceleration ~75 amp / period^2)"
    },
    "arm_beat": {
      "part": "arm", "mode": "additive", "stroke": 0.35,
      "params": {"amp_deg": [8.0, 12.0], "period_s": [1.3, 1.6]},
      "keys": [{"at": 0.0, "wrist_flex": 0.0}, {"at": 0.35, "wrist_flex": "$amp_deg"}, {"at": 1.0, "wrist_flex": 0.0}],
      "note": "a down-stroke of the wrist and its rebound; a beat wants 0.15-0.25 s, the caps give 0.45 s (timid until raised)"
    },
    "arm_flourish": {
      "part": "arm", "mode": "additive", "stroke": 0.3,
      "params": {"roll_deg": [15.0, 25.0], "lift_deg": [4.0, 8.0], "period_s": [2.2, 2.8]},
      "keys": [{"at": 0.0, "wrist_roll": 0.0, "wrist_flex": 0.0}, {"at": 0.3, "wrist_roll": "$roll_deg", "wrist_flex": "-$lift_deg"}, {"at": 0.7, "wrist_roll": "$roll_deg", "wrist_flex": "-$lift_deg"}, {"at": 1.0, "wrist_roll": 0.0, "wrist_flex": 0.0}],
      "mirror": ["wrist_roll"],
      "note": "the hand opened outward by the wrist alone (a shrug's open palm); the shoulder only moves through taught poses"
    },
    "wrist_turn": {
      "part": "arm", "mode": "additive", "stroke": 0.25,
      "params": {"amp_deg": [10.0, 15.0], "period_s": [1.9, 2.1], "repeats": [1, 2]},
      "keys": [{"at": 0.0, "wrist_roll": 0.0}, {"at": 0.3, "wrist_roll": "$amp_deg"}, {"at": 0.7, "wrist_roll": "-$amp_deg"}, {"at": 1.0, "wrist_roll": 0.0}],
      "mirror": ["wrist_roll"],
      "note": "so-so: the wrist rolled one way and the other"
    },
    "gripper_click": {
      "part": "arm", "mode": "additive", "stroke": 1.0,
      "params": {"amp_deg": [10.0, 15.0], "period_s": [1.0, 1.2], "repeats": [1, 3]},
      "keys": [{"at": 0.0, "gripper": 0.0}, {"at": 0.5, "gripper": "$amp_deg"}, {"at": 1.0, "gripper": 0.0}],
      "note": "open and shut (the stroke: shut); a menacing click wants 2-3 Hz, the caps give 1 Hz: the gripper's caps are the first to raise"
    },
    "gripper_set": {
      "part": "arm", "mode": "additive", "stroke": 0.3,
      "params": {"amp_deg": [10.0, 40.0], "period_s": [2.0, 3.0]},
      "keys": [{"at": 0.0, "gripper": 0.0}, {"at": 0.3, "gripper": "$amp_deg"}, {"at": 0.7, "gripper": "$amp_deg"}, {"at": 1.0, "gripper": 0.0}],
      "note": "the gripper opened by amp_deg, held, shut"
    },
    "face": {
      "part": "face", "mode": "absolute", "stroke": 0.0,
      "params": {"period_s": 0.1, "hold_s": [1.5, 2.5]},
      "keys": [{"at": 0.0, "expression": "$name"}],
      "note": "one of config/face.json's expressions (name), held hold_s, then the face lapses to what stood before"
    }
  },
  "compositions": {
    "greeting": {
      "cooldown_s": 30.0,
      "note": "hello: a happy face a little before the word, the head up, the hand raised and waved",
      "variants": [
        {"weight": 2.0, "steps": [
          {"atom": "face", "at_s": [-0.3, -0.2], "params": {"name": "happy", "hold_s": [2.0, 3.0]}},
          {"atom": "head_back", "p": 0.8, "params": {"amp_deg": [3.0, 5.0]}},
          {"atom": "arm_pose", "at_s": [-0.2, 0.0], "params": {"pose": "raised", "hold_s": [3.4, 3.8]}},
          {"atom": "arm_wave", "at_s": [0.6, 0.9], "p": 0.7, "params": {"repeats": 2}},
          {"atom": "head_nod", "at_s": [0.6, 0.9], "p": 0.5, "params": {"amp_deg": [2.0, 4.0]}}
        ]},
        {"weight": 1.0, "steps": [
          {"atom": "face", "at_s": [-0.3, -0.1], "params": {"name": ["smile", "happy"], "hold_s": [2.0, 3.0]}},
          {"atom": "head_nod", "params": {"amp_deg": [3.0, 5.0]}},
          {"atom": "gripper_click", "at_s": [0.3, 0.6], "p": 0.5, "params": {"repeats": 2}}
        ]}
      ]
    },
    "farewell": {
      "cooldown_s": 30.0,
      "note": "bye: a smile, a slower wave or a nod, the head dropped a little after",
      "variants": [
        {"weight": 3.0, "steps": [
          {"atom": "face", "at_s": [-0.2, 0.0], "params": {"name": "smile", "hold_s": [2.0, 3.0]}},
          {"atom": "arm_pose", "at_s": [-0.2, 0.0], "p": 0.6, "params": {"pose": "raised", "hold_s": [3.5, 3.8]}},
          {"atom": "arm_wave", "at_s": [0.6, 0.9], "p": 0.6, "params": {"period_s": [1.6, 1.7], "repeats": 2}},
          {"atom": "head_drop", "at_s": [0.8, 1.2], "p": 0.3, "params": {"amp_deg": [2.0, 3.0]}}
        ]},
        {"weight": 2.0, "steps": [
          {"atom": "face", "at_s": [-0.2, 0.0], "params": {"name": "smile", "hold_s": [2.0, 3.0]}},
          {"atom": "head_nod", "params": {"amp_deg": [3.0, 5.0], "period_s": [0.45, 0.5]}}
        ]}
      ]
    },
    "laugh": {
      "cooldown_s": 20.0,
      "note": "the face first, the head thrown back on the word, then a bob of the head (or a wiggle of the body); the gripper chatters now and then",
      "variants": [
        {"weight": 2.0, "steps": [
          {"atom": "face", "at_s": [-0.1, 0.0], "params": {"name": ["grin", "happy"], "hold_s": [2.0, 3.0]}},
          {"atom": "head_back", "params": {"amp_deg": [6.0, 12.0], "period_s": [1.2, 1.6]}},
          {"atom": "head_nod", "at_s": [1.4, 1.7], "p": 0.5, "params": {"amp_deg": [2.0, 3.0], "lift_deg": 0.5, "period_s": [0.45, 0.5], "repeats": [2, 3]}},
          {"atom": "gripper_click", "at_s": [0.3, 0.6], "p": 0.2, "params": {"repeats": [1, 2]}}
        ]},
        {"weight": 1.0, "steps": [
          {"atom": "face", "at_s": [-0.1, 0.0], "params": {"name": "happy", "hold_s": [2.0, 3.0]}},
          {"atom": "head_back", "params": {"amp_deg": [6.0, 10.0]}},
          {"atom": "body_wiggle", "at_s": [0.3, 0.5], "p": 0.5}
        ]}
      ]
    },
    "doubt": {
      "cooldown_s": 15.0,
      "note": "hmm: a skewed mouth, the wrist so-so, the head down a little and aside",
      "variants": [
        {"steps": [
          {"atom": "face", "at_s": [-0.2, 0.0], "params": {"name": ["thinking", "flat"], "hold_s": [2.0, 3.0]}},
          {"atom": "wrist_turn", "at_s": [0.0, 0.3], "p": 0.6},
          {"atom": "head_drop", "p": 0.5, "params": {"amp_deg": [2.0, 3.0]}},
          {"atom": "head_glance", "at_s": [0.2, 0.4], "p": 0.5, "params": {"side_deg": [6.0, 10.0], "up_deg": [0.0, 2.0]}}
        ]}
      ]
    },
    "thinking": {
      "cooldown_s": 10.0,
      "note": "a look away up and to a side, the thinking mouth (also the slow tool's moment: it fills the wait)",
      "variants": [
        {"steps": [
          {"atom": "head_glance", "params": {"side_deg": [12.0, 20.0], "up_deg": [4.0, 8.0], "period_s": [2.0, 2.6]}},
          {"atom": "face", "params": {"name": "thinking", "hold_s": [2.0, 3.0]}}
        ]}
      ]
    },
    "emphasis": {
